## Original Content
ऑस्ट्रेलिया के पूर्व बल्लेबाज विल पुकोव्स्की ने 16 साल की उम्र में लगी कन्कशन चोट को लेकर अपने स्कूल ब्राइटन ग्रामर के खिलाफ मुकदमा दायर किया है. पुकोव्स्की ने करियर में 13 कन्कशन झेले और 27 साल की उम्र में क्रिकेट छोड़ दिया.

## Summary
Former Australian cricketer Will Pucovski has filed a lawsuit against his school, Brighton Grammar, for a concussion injury he sustained at age 16. Pucovski endured 13 concussions throughout his career, leading to his retirement from cricket at the age of 27.

## Key Points
- Will Pucovski sued his school for a concussion injury from when he was 16 years old.
- He suffered 13 concussions during his cricket career.
- Pucovski retired from professional cricket at age 27 due to the cumulative effects of concussions.


